    "title"             "Knox Relay"
    "description"       "Server-side bridge mod for remote server management. Exports game state, inventory snapshots, player positions and progression, and processes item delivery and money deposit queues via file-based JSON communication."
    "changenote"    "1.6 — inventory snapshots now address each bag by the id of the item holding it instead of by its display name, so a player carrying two bags with the same name no longer has both sets of contents reported as one container; snapshots carry a containers tree with explicit parent links, capacity, contents weight and a worn flag; a worn bag the engine keeps out of the main inventory listing is now reported as an item as well as a container, instead of its contents appearing under a container nothing holds"
}
